  "description": "Non-material amendment to planning permission 17/AP/4546, which gave consent for: \r\r\"Demolition of existing building and erection of a part 5, 8 and 9 storey plus basement mixed-use development (max height 29.98m) comprising 2,351 sqm (gia) of flexible workspace (Use Class B1) and 84 residential apartments (Use Class C3) with associated amenity space and ancillary infrastructure\".\r\rThe non-material amendments sought by 17/AP/4546 (as amended by 19/AP/2120, 20/AP/2508, 22/AP/2563, 22/AP/4267 and 23/AP/0417)   are to:\r  -  amend the development description to read \"Demolition of existing building and erection of a part 5, 8 and 9 storey plus basement mixed-use development (max height 29.98m) comprising of flexible commercial floorspace (Use Class E) and 84 residential apartments (Use Class C3) with associated amenity space and ancillary infrastructure\"; and\r  -  introduce a new condition (Condition 30) stipulating the exact Use Class E sub-categories that are permitted.\r",
